⚔️ Autoencoder vs PCA

| Feature       | Autoencoder    | PCA                |
| ------------- | -------------- | ------------------ |
| Type          | Neural Network | Statistical Method |
| Flexibility   | High           | Low                |
| Non-linearity | Yes            | No                 |
| Performance   | Better         | Limited            |

