🧠 Why Autoencoders are Important?

✔ Learn compressed representations
✔ Useful in preprocessing for ML models
✔ Foundation for generative models (VAE)
✔ Used in modern AI systems

---

🚨 Important Connection

Autoencoders → Representation Learning → Deep Learning → Generative AI

